<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  Themed-icon layer (Android 13+). The launcher tints this with the user's wallpaper
  palette, so it must be one flat shape with no colour of its own.

  This is the only place Monet touches the app, and it is unavoidable because the system
  draws it rather than we do. It is also harmless: there is no gold here to lose its
  meaning, since the whole layer is a single colour by definition.
-->
